# Home and rooms

The home overview answers three questions: what needs attention, what is happening and what can I control?


## Choose complete room cards

Use the [card decision guide](../components/cards.html#choose-the-card-by-its-job) to choose room navigation, information, device-action and status cards. Its image, long-name and responsive-group examples demonstrate complete content and destinations. An illustration supplements the room identity; it is not evidence of live state.

The device-group specimen below now lists its two configured members, dated reported states and a separate details route. Its preview acknowledges a local request only. A connected overview must include unavailable configured members in group summaries and must not infer targets from a shared room name.

